    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Running minimum</span><span class=\"chip\">Kadane on differences</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/best-time-to-buy-and-sell-stock/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 121</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: the best sale on day j always uses the cheapest day before j, so carry the running minimum and test one sale per day. One pass, O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
